    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθυπερ-ηφᾰνέω</span></b> , strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερηφανέω</span>, Arg. <i><span class="en">
